                    Founded in 2007, Excel Educational Institute began with a single mission: to make Chartered Accountancy accessible to every deserving student in Chhattisgarh. What started as a small batch of dedicated Commerce students in Raipur has grown into the region's most respected CA coaching institution, now serving over 3,000 students annually.
