                    <div class="accordion-item">
                        <h3 class="accordion-header" id="faqHeading1">
                            <button class="accordion-button" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#faqCollapse1" aria-expanded="true" aria-controls="faqCollapse1">
                                Q1. What is CA Foundation and who should join it?
                            </button>
                        </h3>
                        <div id="faqCollapse1" class="accordion-collapse collapse show" aria-labelledby="faqHeading1" data-bs-parent="#faqAccordion30">
                            <div class="accordion-body text-secondary">
                                CA Foundation is the first level of the Chartered Accountancy course conducted by ICAI. Any student who has passed Class 12 from any stream — Commerce, Science, or Arts — can register for CA Foundation. There is no upper age limit. Commerce students with Accountancy background tend to find the transition smoother, but Science and Arts students who study diligently under proper guidance like that offered at Excel Educational Institute clear Foundation comfortably. CA Foundation is an excellent career choice for students who enjoy numbers, law, and finance and aspire to a high-paying, respected profession.
                            </div>
