                                Q18. Does Excel provide doubt-clearing sessions?
                            </button>
                        </h3>
                        <div id="faqCollapse18" class="accordion-collapse collapse" aria-labelledby="faqHeading18" data-bs-parent="#faqAccordion30">
                            <div class="accordion-body text-secondary">
                                Yes, dedicated doubt-clearing sessions are a core component of Excel's teaching methodology. We schedule subject-specific doubt sessions every weekday evening after regular classes, where students can ask questions from any topic covered during the course. Faculty are also available for individual doubts before and after class. Online students have access to a dedicated doubt WhatsApp group where queries are answered by subject teachers within hours.
