                                Excel Educational Institute offers multiple batch timings to suit different student schedules. Morning batches typically run from 7:00 AM to 11:00 AM, afternoon batches from 12:00 PM to 4:00 PM, and evening batches from 5:00 PM to 8:00 PM. Combined Class 11/12 + CA Foundation batches have specially designed schedules that accommodate school/college hours. For online students across India, live classes are generally scheduled in evening slots to accommodate school commitments.
