                                To appear for CA Foundation, students must register with ICAI before the cutoff date on the ICAI Self-Service Portal (eservices.icai.org). After creating an account, students fill personal and educational details, upload required documents (Class 10 and 12 mark sheets, ID proof, photograph, and signature), and pay the registration fee (approx ₹9,000). A mandatory 4-month study period must be completed before appearing in the exam. Our counsellors assist all enrolled students with registration guidance.
