                        <div id="faqCollapse25" class="accordion-collapse collapse" aria-labelledby="faqHeading25" data-bs-parent="#faqAccordionRemaining">
                            <div class="accordion-body text-secondary">
                                The Direct Entry Route allows certain students to skip CA Foundation and directly enter CA Intermediate. Students eligible for this route include: Commerce graduates and postgraduates with 55% marks in aggregate, Non-commerce graduates and postgraduates with 60% marks, and students who have passed the Intermediate level of ICSI (CS) or ICAI-CMA. For all other students — which includes most Class 12 passers — CA Foundation is the mandatory first step. Excel Educational Institute also offers coaching for the Direct Entry Route Intermediate program for eligible graduates.
