                                Q26. What career opportunities are available after becoming a CA?
                            </button>
                        </h3>
                        <div id="faqCollapse26" class="accordion-collapse collapse" aria-labelledby="faqHeading26" data-bs-parent="#faqAccordionRemaining">
                            <div class="accordion-body text-secondary">
                                A Chartered Accountant has one of the most diverse career paths in India. Career options include Statutory Audit in Big 4 or mid-size CA firms, Tax Consultancy (Direct and Indirect taxes including GST), Internal Audit & Risk Management, Financial Planning and Analysis as CFO or Finance Manager, Investment Banking, Management Consulting, and Entrepreneurship by establishing their own CA practice. The CA qualification is also recognised globally in countries like the USA, UK, Canada, Australia, and the UAE.
