                                    <li><strong>50% Scholarship:</strong> For students scoring 80–89% in Class 12 (subject to scholarship test).</li>
                                    <li><strong>30% Discount:</strong> For Economically Weaker Section (EWS) students with valid income certificates.</li>
                                    <li><strong>25% Sibling Discount:</strong> When two or more siblings enroll simultaneously.</li>
